{"4592470": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "GUTSPILL", "steam_appid": 4592470, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use the environment to your advantage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The architecture is your deadliest weapon. Use powerful kicks to hurl enemies into exposed spikes, launch them off ledges, or shatter boxes against them to clear the room instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592470/extras/3763cf2dd8aceb324d2a617bfe81cff8.poster.avif?t=1787863873\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592470/extras/3763cf2dd8aceb324d2a617bfe81cff8.webm?t=1787863873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592470/extras/3763cf2dd8aceb324d2a617bfe81cff8.mp4?t=1787863873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brutalize your enemies with your hammer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver heavy impacts that cursh anything in their path and watch how their heads explode in a satisfying manner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592470/extras/47f665cdc04477c5f19aedacabbce98a.poster.avif?t=1787863873\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592470/extras/47f665cdc04477c5f19aedacabbce98a.webm?t=1787863873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592470/extras/47f665cdc04477c5f19aedacabbce98a.mp4?t=1787863873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feed to Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must cannibalize your fallen foes mid-combat to heal. However, you can only feed if their heads remain intact. Forcing you to constantly balance raw damage against the need to heal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592470/extras/44802d7c2341ed06bb2aece41a86d0fe.poster.avif?t=1787863873\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592470/extras/44802d7c2341ed06bb2aece41a86d0fe.webm?t=1787863873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592470/extras/44802d7c2341ed06bb2aece41a86d0fe.mp4?t=1787863873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use the environment to your advantage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The architecture is your deadliest weapon. Use powerful kicks to hurl enemies into exposed spikes, launch them off ledges, or shatter boxes against them to clear the room instantly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592470/extras/3763cf2dd8aceb324d2a617bfe81cff8.poster.avif?t=1787863873\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592470/extras/3763cf2dd8aceb324d2a617bfe81cff8.webm?t=1787863873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592470/extras/3763cf2dd8aceb324d2a617bfe81cff8.mp4?t=1787863873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brutalize your enemies with your hammer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deliver heavy impacts that cursh anything in their path and watch how their heads explode in a satisfying manner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592470/extras/47f665cdc04477c5f19aedacabbce98a.poster.avif?t=1787863873\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592470/extras/47f665cdc04477c5f19aedacabbce98a.webm?t=1787863873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592470/extras/47f665cdc04477c5f19aedacabbce98a.mp4?t=1787863873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Feed to Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must cannibalize your fallen foes mid-combat to heal. However, you can only feed if their heads remain intact. Forcing you to constantly balance raw damage against the need to heal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592470/extras/44802d7c2341ed06bb2aece41a86d0fe.poster.avif?t=1787863873\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592470/extras/44802d7c2341ed06bb2aece41a86d0fe.webm?t=1787863873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4592470/extras/44802d7c2341ed06bb2aece41a86d0fe.mp4?t=1787863873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "GUTSPILL is a brutal horror game where you use a hammer and kicks to destroy and cannibalize your enemies using the environment to your advantage. Survive a descent into madness where everything becomes increasingly surreal and visceral.", "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain", "head